        "sid": "GEN 50"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "50",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu wiponya a halī ise, ūlīla no kūnū akūmbipaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yosefu ūbalagīla batūmami bakwe, a bafumu abo bamanile kūtūūlīla mimba būgota gūleke kūgunda wangū; būntūūlīla ū būgota wenūbo ū ise ū Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nīmo gwenūyo gwashishaga shikū makūmi anè gūkwītagwa; na lūūlū aho jashikana, a Bamisili būnīla ikanza lya shikū makūmi mpungatī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo kūjūjīkwa Kanaani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jahayūshila ī shikū ja kūlīla, ū Yosefu ūbawīla a banhū ba ng'wikūlū lya ng'wa Falao gīkī, “Ūlū mulīzunya kūnigunanha, nalīmulomba muhooye nū Falao; mung'wīle gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ū baba akaniilahīja alīhaya gīkī, Ī haha nalī hihī kūcha, ūkūjūnijīkīla Kanaani mu shigila nisīmbīla nene ng'wenekīlī;’ ali lūūlū, nalīlomba ūnizunīlīje naje nakanjīke ū baba, nakūshoka hangī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Falao ūng'wīla, “Jaga dūhū ūkanjīke ū so gīt'umo akakwilahīgīja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana ū Yosefu ūja ū kūnjīka ū ise; pye a bana ng'oma ba ng'wa Falao na a batūmami ba ha ng'wakwe būja, na a bataale ba mu sī ya Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī kaya ya ng'wa Yosefu ī yose īkaja, nī kaya ja baana ba ng'wawe, na a bangī pye a ba mu kaya ya ng'wa ise. Ī Gosheni būūbaleka baana babo dūhū, na madaale ga mitugo jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaja n'ibità itaale no; baja mu magogoteeni, bangī ha falasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bashika ha lūbūūga lwa kūtūlīla būsīga lwa Atadi, bbihī na mongo gwa Yolodani, būlīla ng'hūngū mu kalīlīle ka būpīna būtaale no; aho balī henaho ū Yosefu ūlagīla badīle ho shikū mpungatī bakūnīlaga ū ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bana Kanaani ba mhandī jenījo aho bababona balīlīla ng'hūngū a ha lūbūūga lwa Atadi; būhaya, “A Bamisili benaba balī ng'wikanza idito lya kūlīla ng'hūngū.” H'ī nguno yene ī lipandī lya bbihī na Yolodani lyenīlo līkitanagwa Abeli-mizilaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a bitūnja bakwe ū Yakobo bakīīta gīt'umo walī wabalagīīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būmūcha būntwala kū sī ya Kanaani, būūkanjīka ng'wipilinga īlo lyalī ng'wilaale lya Makipela hihī na Mamule, īlo walī walīgūla Abulahamu hamò nī lilaale lyenīlo, kūfuma kūlī Efuloni Ng'hītī kūlwa kūyūjīkīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu aho wamala ū kūnjīka ū ise, ūshoka ng'hana ī Misili, hamò na a baana ba ng'wawe, na a bangī abo baalī baja nang'hwe ū kūnjīka ū ise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosefu kūbatimbya ng'holò bakūlūye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakūūlye ū Yosefu aho babona ū saabo wazumalīka, bakiwīla gīkī, “Ī gīsī īkūja ginehe ng'hana ū Yosefu ūlū ūbiza ataalī atūpelanīlile, hūna ūhaya kūtūmalīla shiilī kūlwa yose ī mibi īyo twang'wītīla a bise?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būntūmīla nhūng'wa balīhaya gīkī, “Ū so aho ataalī kūzumalīka, akaleka watūwīla mhayo; ūhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ū Yosefu mulang'wīle gīkī, A bakūlūyo bakakwītīla mibi no ī chene, alīyo nalīkūlomba ūbalekeje ū būkenaagūji wabo, nī shibi īsho bakwītīla.’ Na lūūlū tūlīkwikūmbīlīja ūtūlekeje ī shibi shise a bise batūmami ba ng'wa Mulungu wa ng'wa so.” Ū Yosefu aho wagwigwa ū mhayo gwabo, ūlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho a bakūlūye biza a ha ng'wakwe, būshikīla kūgwa kū būtongi bokwe balīhaya gīkī, “A bise tūlī basese bako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yosefu ūbawīla, “Mutoogohage a bing'we muliganika ū nene nalī ha ng'wanya gwa ng'wa Mulungu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ī chene a bing'we ng'walī na ng'hūmbū ja kūnīītīla yabūbi; alīyo ū Mulungu akītūmamīla ī yenīyo kwīta īyo īlīho ī haha; kūpīja būpanga wa banhū bingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a bing'we lekagi ū kogoha, ū nene nakūmugunanha pye na a baana bing'we.” Ūbazenga na kūbatimbya ng'holò mu kalūngalūngīle ka kūbalūngūja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūcha kwa ng'wa Yosefu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu akikala mu Misili ng'wenūmo, nī kaya ya ng'wa ise ī yose. Ū būlamu bokwe akashisha myaka igana n'ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbabona a banhū bakwe kūshisha shibyalīlwe sha kadatū ū mu baana ba ng'wa Efulaimu. Na a baana ba ng'wa Makili, ū ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Manase, bakabyalwa būlelwa ha matango ga ng'wa Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yosefu ūbawīla a baana ba ng'wawe gīkī, “Ū nene nalī hihī kūcha, alīyo namanile hape ū Mulungu akwiza, ang'wīnje ū mu sī yenīyī, amutwale ū kū sī īyo walī wabisagīja ba Abulahamu, Isaka na Yakobo, ūbilahīlīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu ūbīīta a baana ba ng'wa Isilaeli kūnahīlīla; ūhaya, “Namanile gīkī ū Mulungu akūmugeniha ang'wīnje ū ng'wenūmu; hūna lūūlū mukūgabūūcha na a maguha gane muje nago.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yosefu ūzumalīka, alī na būlamu bo myaka igana n'ikūmi. Aho bamala kūgūtūūlīla ū mimba būgota wa kūgūlang'hana gūtizūgunda, būgūtūūla ng'wisandīko mumo Misili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
